abstract: >
  Clean-room audit and retained full-scale evidence record for Gaussian Mean
  Field Variational Inference can Overestimate Predictive Variance. The audit
  checks the spherical-prior mechanism, empirical training-distribution
  comparison, and first-principal-direction result while preserving the
  external-code and data boundary.
